WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.634
-Donald Trump is lashing out

00:00:02.634 --> 00:00:05.701
at Fox boss Rupert Murdoch
amid the ongoing fallout

00:00:05.701 --> 00:00:07.534
from a billion-dollar
defamation lawsuit

00:00:07.534 --> 00:00:09.968
in which Murdoch admitted
that several Fox hosts lied

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:11.734
to their viewers
about the 2020 election.

00:00:11.734 --> 00:00:15.067
In fact, Murdoch even confessed
that platforming those lies

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:16.601
was a business decision.

00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:18.934
The court filing also revealed
that Fox and Murdoch

00:00:18.934 --> 00:00:20.667
were secretly helping
the Trump campaign.

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:22.834
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:22.834 --> 00:00:26.968
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:26.968 --> 00:00:28.100
For years, now,

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:30.267
the shtick over at Fox
has been the same.

00:00:30.267 --> 00:00:32.334
They lie to their viewers
while simultaneously

00:00:32.334 --> 00:00:33.667
telling those same viewers

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:35.868
that it's the rest of the media
who's lying to them

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:38.734
and that Fox is the only outlet
telling the truth.

00:00:38.734 --> 00:00:40.801
Even now, after their lies
have been exposed

00:00:40.801 --> 00:00:42.067
in a series of court filings,

00:00:42.067 --> 00:00:43.968
they're still doing
that same shtick.

00:00:43.968 --> 00:00:46.901
-They lie to you
over and over again.

00:00:46.901 --> 00:00:49.434
How many Americans
believe these lies?

00:00:49.434 --> 00:00:51.634
-It makes me angry
because they're lying.

00:00:51.634 --> 00:00:52.968
They're deliberately lying.

00:00:52.968 --> 00:00:54.367
They knew they were lying.

00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:57.100
-I want to challenge people
watching tonight

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:59.567
who don't wear red hats,
don't consider themselves MAGA,

00:00:59.567 --> 00:01:02.234
don't consider themselves
very strong political people.

00:01:02.234 --> 00:01:06.000
I want you to ask yourself how
many times you've been lied to,

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.501
not just by this government,

00:01:07.501 --> 00:01:10.000
but how many times you lied to
by the people whose job it is

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.534
to tell you the truth
in the media.

00:01:12.534 --> 00:01:15.234
-Being lectured about the truth
by Kellyanne Conway is like

00:01:15.234 --> 00:01:17.868
getting lessons on conflict
resolution from Megan.

00:01:17.868 --> 00:01:21.501
[ Laughter and applause ]
They should start spelling
Kellyanne the same way.

00:01:21.501 --> 00:01:22.934
[ Laughter and applause ]
But I'll count.

00:01:22.934 --> 00:01:25.467
I'll count all the times
the government lied to me.

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:26.567
There was that time they claimed

00:01:26.567 --> 00:01:28.133
the inauguration was
the biggest ever.

00:01:28.133 --> 00:01:30.133
There was that time they said
a bunch of people died

00:01:30.133 --> 00:01:32.267
at the Bowling Green massacre,
which is not a thing.

00:01:32.267 --> 00:01:34.334
There was the time they said
the president didn't know

00:01:34.334 --> 00:01:35.434
about hush money payments,

00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:36.801
even though he wrote
the check himself.

00:01:36.801 --> 00:01:39.367
Oh, there was that time
in March of 2020

00:01:39.367 --> 00:01:40.934
when a government official
told us

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:43.167
the coronavirus
was being contained.

00:01:43.167 --> 00:01:44.667
I can't wait to see who this is.

00:01:44.667 --> 00:01:46.934
Maybe it's the liberal media mob
or Sleepy Joe Biden.

00:01:46.934 --> 00:01:49.133
Oh, or that evil Dr. Fauci.

00:01:49.133 --> 00:01:51.167
-The HHS secretary said
this morning

00:01:51.167 --> 00:01:52.601
that we're ramping up,
we're ramping up

00:01:52.601 --> 00:01:54.100
with the commercial labs.
-Why now? Why didn't they do it

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:56.334
while it was contained,
get ahead of it?

00:01:56.334 --> 00:01:58.200
-It is being contained.
And --

00:01:58.200 --> 00:01:59.934
Do you not think
it's being contained?

00:01:59.934 --> 00:02:02.167
[ Laughter ]
-In addition to being
an accomplished liar,

00:02:02.167 --> 00:02:03.667
she always talked to reporters

00:02:03.667 --> 00:02:05.734
like a gossipy teen
at her locker.

00:02:05.734 --> 00:02:08.033
[ As Conway ]
Do you not think Devin's going
to ask me to prom?

00:02:08.033 --> 00:02:10.501
[ Laughter ]
Because he's definitely --

00:02:10.501 --> 00:02:12.000
he's definitely going
to ask me to prom.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.167
He's the star quarterback
and I'm the cheer captain.

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:17.167
[ Laughter ]
"Kellyanne, you're not even
on the cheerleading team."

00:02:17.167 --> 00:02:18.634
Yeah, but I'm cheerful.

00:02:18.634 --> 00:02:21.133
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.133 --> 00:02:22.801
I'm like famously cheerful.

00:02:22.801 --> 00:02:23.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.968 --> 00:02:25.133
Although,
while we're on the topic,

00:02:25.133 --> 00:02:26.434
I'd be remiss
if I didn't mention

00:02:26.434 --> 00:02:29.434
my personal favorite Kellyanne
lie, from April of 2020,

00:02:29.434 --> 00:02:32.634
when she tried to blame everyone
but Trump for the COVID crisis.

00:02:32.634 --> 00:02:35.267
-This is COVID-19,
not COVID 1, folks,

00:02:35.267 --> 00:02:37.267
and so you would think
the people charged

00:02:37.267 --> 00:02:39.667
with the
World Health Organization

00:02:39.667 --> 00:02:41.467
facts and figures

00:02:41.467 --> 00:02:42.501
-Right.
-would be on top of that.

00:02:42.501 --> 00:02:44.067
People should know the facts.

00:02:44.067 --> 00:02:45.968
-Yeah, people should know
the facts,

00:02:45.968 --> 00:02:48.467
like the fact that the 19
in COVID-19 is

00:02:48.467 --> 00:02:52.601
for the year it was discovered,
not because it's the 19th COVID,

00:02:52.601 --> 00:02:55.868
[ Laughter ]
but good on you for thinking
they name diseases

00:02:55.868 --> 00:02:58.167
the same way they name
Fast &amp; Furious movies.

00:02:58.167 --> 00:03:02.200
[ Laughter and applause ]
The coolest part in COVID-19

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:06.334
is when COVID convinces Spanish
flu to come out of retirement

00:03:06.334 --> 00:03:08.767
to help break SARS
out of prison.

00:03:08.767 --> 00:03:10.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:10.501 --> 00:03:12.801
Anyway, the point is
their schtick is falling apart,

00:03:12.801 --> 00:03:14.300
now that we have
definitive proof,

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:16.801
in these court filings from the
billion-dollar Dominion lawsuit,

00:03:16.801 --> 00:03:18.968
that Fox hosts
were not only lying,

00:03:18.968 --> 00:03:20.267
but they knew they were lying.

00:03:20.267 --> 00:03:24.400
-Fox staff were privately
blasting the big lie as BS,

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:27.167
insane, mind blowingly nuts,
reckless.

00:03:27.167 --> 00:03:30.000
-As Trump lawyers
Rudy Giuliani and Sidney Powell

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.467
were making wildly false claims
about rigged voting machines

00:03:33.467 --> 00:03:36.200
after Trump lost in 2020,

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:39.567
private communications reveal
that pro-Trump voices

00:03:39.567 --> 00:03:42.133
at Fox News
were calling it nuts.

00:03:42.133 --> 00:03:44.000
-Breaking news tonight
involving Fox News

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:45.601
and owner Rupert Murdoch,

00:03:45.601 --> 00:03:46.934
acknowledging, under oath,

00:03:46.934 --> 00:03:51.067
Fox News hosts endorsed
false election fraud claims.

00:03:51.067 --> 00:03:53.534
-Fox News boss
Rupert Murdoch said,

00:03:53.534 --> 00:03:57.033
in a sworn deposition,
that any Fox News executives

00:03:57.033 --> 00:04:01.801
who allowed lies about the 2020
election to be broadcast...

00:04:03.234 --> 00:04:04.968
...or...

00:04:04.968 --> 00:04:06.601
-Wow.
Notice he didn't say fired.

00:04:06.601 --> 00:04:07.667
He said got rid of.

00:04:07.667 --> 00:04:09.634
[ Laughter ]
I'd be a little nervous,

00:04:09.634 --> 00:04:11.200
if I worked over at Fox News.

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:12.567
Next time you're
in Rupert's office,

00:04:12.567 --> 00:04:14.934
make sure you're not standing
on top of any trapdoors.

00:04:14.934 --> 00:04:16.934
[ Laughter ]
Now, just as a reminder,

00:04:16.934 --> 00:04:18.534
I don't have
a Rupert Murdoch impression,

00:04:18.534 --> 00:04:21.234
but I do have a borderline
offensive Australian accent,

00:04:21.234 --> 00:04:22.767
so, I think,
if you were in your office,

00:04:22.767 --> 00:04:23.801
it would go a little
something like this.

00:04:23.801 --> 00:04:24.901
[ Australian accent ]
Uh, listen, Tom,

00:04:24.901 --> 00:04:25.801
I --

00:04:25.801 --> 00:04:28.534
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.534 --> 00:04:30.200
We're going to have
to get rid of ya, mate,

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:32.067
but we got a pretty good
severance package for you.

00:04:32.067 --> 00:04:33.200
I'd love to fill you in on it.

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:34.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:34.634 --> 00:04:38.033
Before I do, just move to the
left a little bit, alright?

00:04:38.033 --> 00:04:40.734
[ Laughter ]
And now forward a little bit.

00:04:40.734 --> 00:04:43.467
[ Laughter ]
Yeah, that's great.
That's great and, uh, perfect.

00:04:43.467 --> 00:04:44.734
And one last thing, Tom.

00:04:44.734 --> 00:04:47.167
Say hi to the sharks for me,
you son of a bitch!

00:04:47.167 --> 00:04:49.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:49.934 --> 00:04:50.834
Thank you.

00:04:50.834 --> 00:04:52.234
[ Cheering ]

00:04:52.234 --> 00:04:55.033
You know it's nice
because it's --

00:04:55.033 --> 00:04:56.267
it's like borderline offensive.

00:04:56.267 --> 00:04:57.567
It's right on that border.

00:04:57.567 --> 00:04:59.334
[ Laughter ]

00:04:59.334 --> 00:05:00.634
Now, as we've discussed
this week,

00:05:00.634 --> 00:05:02.701
Murdoch and the Fox hosts
knew they were lying

00:05:02.701 --> 00:05:04.300
and admitted in private
they were lying,

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:05.701
but it wasn't just the lying.

00:05:05.701 --> 00:05:08.601
As bad as that is,
Fox was also actively helping

00:05:08.601 --> 00:05:10.601
and providing material aid
to the Trump campaign

00:05:10.601 --> 00:05:11.734
during the 2020 election.

00:05:28.834 --> 00:05:31.567
So, Fox allegedly took
confidential company information

00:05:31.567 --> 00:05:32.868
about Biden campaign ads

00:05:32.868 --> 00:05:35.234
and gave that information
to the Trump campaign.

00:05:35.234 --> 00:05:37.167
That is shocking.
Also,

00:05:37.167 --> 00:05:39.834
I can't imagine how it
could've possibly helped Trump,

00:05:39.834 --> 00:05:42.100
since the basic gist
of Biden's campaign was,

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:44.133
"I'm normal and he's
out of his [bleep] mind."

00:05:44.133 --> 00:05:47.200
[ Laughter and applause ]
I mean, what were those
strategy sessions like?

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:48.434
[ As Trump ]
I just heard from Rupert.

00:05:48.434 --> 00:05:50.000
He says Biden's ads are all

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:52.000
about how he's normal
and I'm weird.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.734
So, we got to start doing ads
where I look and sound normal.

00:05:54.734 --> 00:05:58.267
Let's do some shots of me doing
normal stuff in my wheelhouse,

00:05:58.267 --> 00:06:00.767
like drinking water,
hugging a flag,

00:06:00.767 --> 00:06:03.734
using an umbrella,
and looking directly at the sun.

00:06:03.734 --> 00:06:06.133
[ Laughter and applause ]
The sun. We love the sun,

00:06:06.133 --> 00:06:08.701
don't we, folks? And we just --
we want to touch it.

00:06:08.701 --> 00:06:10.400
We want to touch the sun.
I had a friend,

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:11.934
[ Laughter ]
a dear friend,

00:06:11.934 --> 00:06:13.534
a dear friend, a Greek guy.

00:06:13.534 --> 00:06:16.667
His name was Daedalus,
Dedalus -- either one's fine.

00:06:16.667 --> 00:06:18.133
[ Laughter ]
Both are okay.

00:06:18.133 --> 00:06:19.501
I never quite learned how
to say it.

00:06:19.501 --> 00:06:21.434
He had a son, Icarus.
They made a pair of wings.

00:06:21.434 --> 00:06:22.234
Beautiful wings.

00:06:22.234 --> 00:06:23.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:23.467 --> 00:06:24.934
Beautiful wings out of beeswax.

00:06:24.934 --> 00:06:26.167
And I was there
when they took off

00:06:26.167 --> 00:06:27.634
and Daedalus,
he said to his son, "Ic" --

00:06:27.634 --> 00:06:29.467
That's what I called him.
I called him Ic. I said --

00:06:29.467 --> 00:06:31.467
[ Laughter and applause ]
He said to him, he said,

00:06:31.467 --> 00:06:32.868
"Don't fly too close
to the sun,"

00:06:32.868 --> 00:06:34.534
but then I took him aside
and said, "If I were you,

00:06:34.534 --> 00:06:36.367
I'd try to get
as close as you can, Izzie.

00:06:36.367 --> 00:06:37.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:37.467 --> 00:06:38.968
Because it looks like
a big gold coin.

00:06:38.968 --> 00:06:40.133
It might be gold.
You never know.

00:06:40.133 --> 00:06:42.334
You got to get
as close as you can.

00:06:42.334 --> 00:06:44.234
And Ickie took my advice
and his wings melted.

00:06:44.234 --> 00:06:45.734
He fell right into the sea.

00:06:45.734 --> 00:06:48.100
[ Laughter and applause ]
Big old splash.

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:49.200
It was so sad.

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:51.534
[ Laughter ]
So -- The saddest splash.

00:06:51.534 --> 00:06:53.167
And I remember his dad came

00:06:53.167 --> 00:06:54.534
over to me, he said,
"Did you see what happened?"

00:06:54.534 --> 00:06:56.601
And I just looked at him.
I said, "Hey,

00:06:56.601 --> 00:06:57.734
it's none of my beeswax."

00:06:57.734 --> 00:06:59.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:59.834 --> 00:07:00.634
Also --

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:03.968
[ Cheering ]

00:07:03.968 --> 00:07:07.067
Also, they gave --
they gave Trump debate strategy?

00:07:07.067 --> 00:07:09.534
What was Rupert Murdoch's
genius debate tip,

00:07:09.534 --> 00:07:12.667
just snort Adderall and never
stop talking for 90 minutes?

00:07:12.667 --> 00:07:14.100
-You got to be kidding.
-Not malicious.

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.234
-Chris, he's so wrong when he
makes a statement like that.

00:07:16.234 --> 00:07:17.868
Oh, well,
that's a big statement.
-If you let --

00:07:17.868 --> 00:07:19.200
I support the block --
-That means you just lost

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:21.000
the radical left, gone.
-I supp--

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.234
-They said it would take --
No, you were number two.

00:07:23.234 --> 00:07:24.968
China ate your lunch, Joe.

00:07:24.968 --> 00:07:27.067
-He said, "Stupid bastards."
-Mister -- Please.

00:07:27.067 --> 00:07:28.167
-Not true.
-He said.

00:07:28.167 --> 00:07:30.868
[ Laughter ]
-Good debate prep, Rupert!

00:07:30.868 --> 00:07:33.434
[ Australian accent ]
Remember, Donald, everyone
trusts a screamer!

00:07:33.434 --> 00:07:35.367
[ Laughter ]

00:07:35.367 --> 00:07:37.334
This is an especially
shocking revelation,

00:07:37.334 --> 00:07:38.601
but, of course,
it's also not surprising.

00:07:38.601 --> 00:07:40.567
There's been a long
symbiotic relationship

00:07:40.567 --> 00:07:42.234
between Fox News
and the Republican Party

00:07:42.234 --> 00:07:43.968
and that relationship
only intensified

00:07:43.968 --> 00:07:45.033
during the Trump era.

00:07:45.033 --> 00:07:46.567
On-air personalities,
like Sean Hannity

00:07:46.567 --> 00:07:49.901
and Jeanine Pirro,
actually campaigned onstage

00:07:49.901 --> 00:07:52.100
with Trump at a rally in 2018

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:54.033
and, even after Trump's
presidency was over,

00:07:54.033 --> 00:07:57.534
Fox host Tucker Carlson was seen
cackling wildly next to Trump

00:07:57.534 --> 00:07:59.634
[ Laughter ]
while watching a Saudi-funded

00:07:59.634 --> 00:08:01.300
golf tournament
at one of Trump's clubs.

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:03.868
So, yes, Murdoch and Fox
helped the Trump campaign

00:08:03.868 --> 00:08:05.667
and spread the lie
that the election was rigged

00:08:05.667 --> 00:08:08.234
for political purposes,
but, as Murdoch freely admitted,

00:08:08.234 --> 00:08:09.634
he also did it for profit.

00:08:09.634 --> 00:08:12.033
In that same court filing,
Murdoch was asked

00:08:12.033 --> 00:08:14.634
why Fox had continued
to give a platform

00:08:14.634 --> 00:08:16.734
to election wingnut
and pillow guy Mike Lindell,

00:08:16.734 --> 00:08:19.367
[ Laughter ]
who spends lots of money
on advertising on Fox,

00:08:19.367 --> 00:08:22.167
and Murdoch said the decision
to platform Lindell

00:08:22.167 --> 00:08:23.467
had nothing to do with politics.

00:08:23.467 --> 00:08:24.300
It was about money.

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:25.801
-Today's filing also reveals,

00:08:25.801 --> 00:08:27.267
"when asked why Fox continues

00:08:27.267 --> 00:08:30.300
to give a platform to,"
for example, Mike Lindell --

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:33.901
"who continues to this day
to [lie] about Dominion --"

00:08:33.901 --> 00:08:38.601
Murdoch said it's not red
or blue, it's green.

00:08:38.601 --> 00:08:41.501
[ Laughter ]
-"It's not red or blue,
it's green," sounds as damning

00:08:41.501 --> 00:08:42.734
as Colonel Jessup saying,

00:08:42.734 --> 00:08:44.501
"You're goddamn right I"
ordered the Code Red.

00:08:44.501 --> 00:08:46.467
[ Laughter and applause ]
When Murdoch said it,

00:08:46.467 --> 00:08:48.767
did the lawyers in the room
make that face Tom Cruise did

00:08:48.767 --> 00:08:51.534
when he couldn't believe
he got the confession?

00:08:51.534 --> 00:08:54.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:55.567
The court filings
also reveal that,

00:08:55.567 --> 00:08:57.434
despite providing aid
to the Trump campaign

00:08:57.434 --> 00:08:59.567
and spreading his lies,
Fox and Murdoch panicked

00:08:59.567 --> 00:09:01.667
and tried to backpedal away
from him

00:09:01.667 --> 00:09:03.367
after the January 6th
insurrection.

00:09:03.367 --> 00:09:05.300
-The court filing makes
clear that,

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:07.100
after the riot at the Capitol,

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:09.767
Murdoch was
through with Donald Trump,

00:09:09.767 --> 00:09:11.167
writing in one email...

00:09:16.434 --> 00:09:18.534
-Too late, mother[bleep].
You built this.

00:09:18.534 --> 00:09:21.067
[ Laughter and applause ]
It's easy to put a brain

00:09:21.067 --> 00:09:22.434
in Frankenstein when he's

00:09:22.434 --> 00:09:24.300
a lifeless body strapped
to a table,

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:25.734
but good luck getting it
out of his head

00:09:25.734 --> 00:09:27.400
while he's lumbering
around a golf course

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:29.601
[ Laughter ]
and interrupting weddings
at Mar-A-Lago

00:09:29.601 --> 00:09:31.067
to give off-the-cuff toasts.

00:09:31.067 --> 00:09:33.801
[ As Trump ]
In conclusion, love is good
and fire --

00:09:33.801 --> 00:09:35.000
fire is bad.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:37.667
To the newlyweds.

00:09:37.667 --> 00:09:39.234
That revelation angered Trump,

00:09:39.234 --> 00:09:42.200
who's been melting down all week
on his fake Twitter service,

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:43.834
trashing Murdoch and Fox News.

00:09:43.834 --> 00:09:45.434
Trump wrote earlier this week...

00:10:04.467 --> 00:10:05.901
"REBUKED &amp; FORSAKEN"?

00:10:05.901 --> 00:10:08.167
It sounds like he asked ChatGPT

00:10:08.167 --> 00:10:10.334
to write a coked-up version
of the Old Testament.

00:10:10.334 --> 00:10:11.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:11.367 --> 00:10:12.901
I also do love when Trump

00:10:12.901 --> 00:10:15.400
starts using big words,
like rebuked and forsaken,

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:18.334
despite the fact that he can't
spell the word stolen.

00:10:18.334 --> 00:10:20.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:20.734 --> 00:10:23.334
We don't know how this case
will turn out.

00:10:23.334 --> 00:10:25.801
We do know that the filings,
once again, prove

00:10:25.801 --> 00:10:27.801
that Fox is not a legitimate
news organization.

00:10:27.801 --> 00:10:29.767
They actively helped
the presidential campaign.

00:10:29.767 --> 00:10:31.200
They knowingly lied
to their viewers.

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:33.100
They tried to backpedal
away from Trump,

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:34.567
but, by then, it was too late

00:10:34.567 --> 00:10:36.133
and now, the monster they've
created is turning on them.

00:10:36.133 --> 00:10:37.534
If Murdoch and his allies

00:10:37.534 --> 00:10:38.834
thought they could simply
get rid of Trump

00:10:38.834 --> 00:10:40.300
after spending years
elevating him,

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:41.267
then I guess they're just...

00:10:41.267 --> 00:10:42.968
-Stupid bastards.

00:10:42.968 --> 00:10:45.334
[ Laughter and applause ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:10:45.334 --> 00:10:48.968
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

